ading"> <p>Featured Tale</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="feature-title"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-terrible-thing">A Terrible Thing</a></p> </div> <div class="feature-subtitle"> <p>by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/riemann" >Riemann</a></span></p> </div> <p><em>The freak comes last. He is larger than the rest. He wears no parka.</em></p> <p>(Featured by Naveil, Riemann, and YellowISlol)</p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/featured-tale-archive-ii">Featured Tale Archive</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="content-panel left-column"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>Featured GoI Format Document</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="feature-title"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/critter-profile-bakugo">Critter Profile: Bakugo!</a></p> </div> <div class="feature-subtitle"> <p>by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" >Ihp</a></span></p> </div> <p><em>Bakugo is a bit standoffish, but he'll eagerly eat an apple out of your hand— or a nightmare out of your brain.</em></p> <p>(Featured by Truc Linh)</p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/featured-goi-format-archive">Featured GoI Format Archive</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="content-panel right-column"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>Reviewers' Spotlight: <em>caspian2</em></p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="feature-title"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5610">SCP-5610: To Put a Cat on Your Head</a></p> </div> <div class="feature-subtitle"> <p>by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" >Veralta</a></span></p> </div> <p><em>Approximately 56 percent of Japan's population has been found to have an instance of SCP-5610 resting atop of their head.</em></p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/reviewers-spotlight-archive">Reviewers' Spotlight Archive</a></p> </div> </div